OL,3,GNEWSAGrowth requires 'difficult
OL,4,Adecisions' - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FImproving workers' rights might have to
OL,7,Ftake "second place" if it stands in the
OL,8,Fway of economic growth, a government
OL,9,Fminister has said.
OL,11,FDeputy Gerald Voisin was speaking after
OL,12,Fappearing with other ministers at an
OL,13,FInstitute of Directors lunch at which
OL,14,Fthey shared their priorities for the
OL,15,Feconomy and business community.
OL,17,FUnite the Union said it was
OL,18,F"particularly distasteful for any
OL,19,Fworkers' rights to be impacted for the
OL,20,Fsake of economic growth" while Reform
OL,21,FJersey also criticised Voisin's
OL,22,Fcomments as "unfortunate".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
