OL,3,GNEWSAGrowth requires 'difficult
OL,4,Adecisions' - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Statistics Jersey, in 2025
OL,7,Fthe economy fell in real terms by 1.7%
OL,8,Fwhile experts who advise the government
OL,9,Fsaid this summer that they expected a
OL,10,Ffurther fall in 2026.
